title: 밤_2_택배_신아산_영문
---
(I'm at a logistics center right now.)
(Is this the fate of a broke college student who has nothing but physical stamina...?)
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
(And on the line next to me, there's a familiar face.)
(Is this the fate of not just me, but all college students...?)
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: Ugh, I've lost track of how many hours it's been.
{name()}: Tell me about it....
{name()}: I've been standing for so long that I can't feel my legs anymore.
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: *Sigh*... If it weren't for that stupid bass...
{name()}: Bass?
ASan: Yeah.
ASan: I started this with the dream of buying a new bass guitar, but I didn't think it would be this hard...
{name()}: For real...
{name()}: The fact that we have to go to class like this tomorrow is just...
ASan: It's unbelievable.
(After that, we chatted for a while.)
(Sharing funny stories even while we were exhausted made the fatigue feel a bit lighter.)
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
ASan: I think it's less painful thanks to you.
ASan: I'm definitely never coming here alone again.
{name()}: ...The way you said that makes it sound like you're planning to drag me along next time?
ASan: Hahaha.
ASan: Anyway, good job today.
{name()}: You too. See you tomorrow.
<<end>>
===